gene herschel was an actor director  writer whose legacy of philanthropy  immortalized his place in cinema history  as the man who gave hollywood his  conscience  in our business many of us leave home  and travel for pleasant work or  we're often wrapped up in filming on  location or busy promoting our projects  we don't always seize the advantage to  immerse ourselves in the places the  people we encounter  through her travels angelina jolie has  taken full advantage of her experiences  to listen  to learn to change her worldview  i met angelina a long time ago  because my daughter  who was i think about 10 at the time  was a huge angelina jolie fan  primarily because of her work and  because of her humanity and um because  we're fighting for what is right  my daughter at 10 was very idealistic  and  a lot of angelina's values had rubbed  off on her  and so  i asked her if she would have lunch with  my daughter and she said sure  and  at that point we sat down and we were  talking and going over things and she  adopted a son and i'd adopted  three children by myself so we were two  basically single parents talking about  children  and  i said  uh  you know children are the pathway to a  compassionate life into happiness and  this is the one true thing you can do is  have children  little that i know she'd take me so  seriously  and not only has she  got a wonderful family but she has done  so much for children around the world  i would expect  uh ultimately that she's probably  hopefully the happiest person in the  world  because she definitely has  a lot of the compassion  she has taken this knowledge to a bigger  place  uh she has worked diligently to make us  aware to compel us to take action  through her storytelling on behalf of  the un  she has opened our eyes to violence to  victimization in sierra leone  tanzania pakistan cambodia ecuador and  rwanda and i'm sure it'll be in many  other places through her storytelling on  film she has depicted the horrors of war  and used her art to illuminate justice  issues and make positive changes in the  world  she's currently filming a true life  account of hope and resilience  and through her passion to tell such  compelling stories on the screen through  her work in washington and around the  globe angelina has come to embody that  conscience associated with gene herschel  and it gives me great pleasure to  present the academy of motion pictures  arts and sciences gene herschel award to  an artist whose humanitarian efforts  continue to touch and inspire the world  angelina jolie  [Applause]
 

